   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I review a teammate's code today. I document the performance so the team can review it later. If the latency fails, we need a clear plan. Priya checks with me, \"Looks good to me.\" I answer clearly, \"Could you clarify this part?\" Before we part, Leo says, \"What are the main differences?\" I answer, \"This one is more reliable.\" The day ends with a clear plan for tomorrow.",
   "tts": "I review a teammate's code today. I document the performance so the team can review it later. If the latency fails, we need a clear plan. Priya checks with me, \"Looks good to me.\" I answer clearly, \"Could you clarify this part?\" Before we part, Leo says, \"What are the main differences?\" I answer, \"This one is more reliable.\" The day ends with a clear plan for tomorrow.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "今天我评审队友的代码。我把性能写成文档，方便团队之后查看。如果延迟失败，我们需要一个清晰的方案。Priya向我确认：\"我看起来没问题。\"我清楚地回答：\"你可以说明这一部分吗？\"分开前，Leo说：\"主要区别是什么？\"我回答：\"这个更可靠。\"这一天以一份清晰的明日计划结束。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "performance",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "性能，系统完成工作的速度和效率"
    },
    {
