     "def": "这个更可靠。"
    },
    {
     "w": "Looks good to me.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我看起来没问题。"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could you clarify this part?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你可以说明这一部分吗？"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The deadline is close, and I ask for one more day. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"The other option is cheaper.\" I reply, \"What are the trade-offs?\" I suggest that we check the cache first. The result depends on the cache hit, so I check it twice. Before we part, Leo says, \"Please add a test.\" I answer, \"This may cause an error.\" I check my notes and confirm the next step.",
   "tts": "The deadline is close, and I ask for one more day. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"The other option is cheaper.\" I reply, \"What are the trade-offs?\" I suggest that we check the cache first. The result depends on the cache hit, so I check it twice. Before we part, Leo says, \"Please add a test.\" I answer, \"This may cause an error.\" I check my notes and confirm the next step.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "截止时间快到了，我请求多一天。一天结束时，Maria说：\"另一个方案更便宜。\"我回答：\"有哪些取舍？\"我建议我们先检查缓存。结果取决于缓存命中，所以我检查了两遍。分开前，Leo说：\"请增加一个测试。\"我回答：\"这可能导致错误。\"我检查笔记，确认了下一步。",
   "hard": [
