    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"Consider renaming this variable.\" I reply, \"Thanks for the update.\" I suggest that we check the cache miss first. The result depends on the response time, so I check it twice. Before we part, Leo says, \"I need time to decide.\" I answer, \"Let's review the facts.\" My comments are kind and clear. The team thanks me.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"Consider renaming this variable.\" I reply, \"Thanks for the update.\" I suggest that we check the cache miss first. The result depends on the response time, so I check it twice. Before we part, Leo says, \"I need time to decide.\" I answer, \"Let's review the facts.\" My comments are kind and clear. The team thanks me.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我给团队写了一份简短的总结。一天结束时，Maria说：\"可以考虑重命名这个变量。\"我回答：\"谢谢你的更新。\"我建议我们先检查缓存未命中。结果取决于响应时间，所以我检查了两遍。分开前，Leo说：\"我需要时间决定。\"我回答：\"我们回顾一下事实吧。\"我的评论友善而清楚。团队向我道谢。",
